  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "A string SSS of length 333 is called cute if it satisfies the following conditions:\n\n\nS1=S3S_1 = S_3S1​=S3​, i.e. its first and last characters are equal, and\nS2=wS_2 = \\texttt{w}S2​=w, i.e. its middle character is `w`.\nSome examples of cute strings are `\"owo\"`, `\"uwu\"`, and `\"qwq\"`; whereas `\"wwf\"` and `\"oco\"` are examples of strings that are not cute.\n\nYou are given a string SSS of length 333. Is it cute?\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first and only line of input contains a string SSS of length 333.\n\n\nOutput Format\nOn a single line, output the answer: `\"Cute\"` (without quotes) if SSS is a cute string, and `\"No\"` (without quotes) otherwise.\n\n\nEach character may be printed in either uppercase or lowercase, i.e. the strings `NO`, `No`, `nO`, and `no` will all be treated as equivalent.",
    "constraints": [
      "SSS has length 333.",
      "Each character of SSS is a lowercase English letter, i.e. one of {’a’,&nbsp;’b’,&nbsp;…,’z’}\\{\\text{'a', 'b', } \\ldots, \\text{'z'}\\}{’a’,&nbsp;’b’,&nbsp;…,’z’}."
    ],
    "inputFormat": "",
    "outputFormat": "",
    "notes": [],
    "sampleTestCases": [
      {
        "id": "sample_1",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "owo",
        "output": "Cute",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n\"owo\" is a cute string, because its middle character is w and its first and third characters are equal."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_2",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "pwp",
        "output": "Cute",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n\"pwp\" is a cute string, because its middle character is w and its first and third characters are equal."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_3",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "pvp",
        "output": "No",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n\"pvp\" is not a cute string, because its middle character is not w."
      },
      {
        "id": "sample_4",
        "type": "reg",
        "input": "awe",
        "output": "No",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\n\"awe\" is not a cute string, because its first and third characters don't match."
      }
    ]
